  m_text: 'The Cleoni people are natives of Streynia and have historically resided
    in the central parts of the country. Cleoni culture is focused on craftsmanship
    and the development of artisan goods, and Cleoni factories made up the majority
    of production in early Streynia, particularly pre-industrialization. '
