  m_text: "The Eskani people are natives of Streynia, historically occupying the
    northern parts of the country. They developed the country\u2019s agriculture
    and worked in tandem with the Cleoni to support the development of early Streynia.
    The Eskani people began to spread around the country with the arrival of the
    Thebreans, and made up the largest portion of the government before the war began. "
